{"kind": "mod", "id": 686, "name": "Dad Gamer Mode", "slug": "dad-gamer-mode", "teaser": "Allows you to heal all damage and avoid fall damage. Use bepinex menu toggle for godmode in game.", "owner_name": "Props", "downloads": 94680, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/926.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:42.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-12-31T20:40:56.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-12-31T20:40:56.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.9.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Time for a rebrand since 3.5.0 testing is finished for the most part.</p>\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Heal all damage and common negative effects. No Falling damage either for God Mode Option.</li>\n<li>Provide No Head Damage Option.</li>\n<li>Allow certain % of damage through so you can take say 10% of the damage you normally would.</li>\n<li>Infinite Stamina Option.</li>\n<li>COD Mode, where health regenerates after a configurable amount of time in the bepinex menu (F12)</li>\n<li>Keep 1 Health option if you want to use bandages but not die.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>To install:</p>\n<p>Drop the dll file within your bepinex/plugins folder.</p>\n<p>If you guys enjoy my work and feel like buying me caffeine, here’s my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/T6T7QSN01\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kofi.</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.7.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5063, "published_at": "2023-10-20T17:48:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/686/dad-gamer-mode/1.7.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies"